// Title: Potential CobaltStrike Process Patterns
// Rule ID: f35c5d71-b489-4e22-a115-f003df287317
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
